  "headword": "spend",
  "ipa": [
    "spend"
  ],
  "star": true,
  "levelMark": true,
  "textbook": [
    "G6下U6"
  ],
  "inflections": "（spent /spent/, spent）",
  "senses": [
    {
      "pos": "v.",
      "zh": "度过；花费（钱、时间等）"
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "He doesn’t "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "spend"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " much time on his homework."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "他花在作业上的时间不多。"
    }
  ],
  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "spend 是常考单词，常出现在保持句意基本不变的句型转换练习中，所以学生一定要掌握其固定搭配，及比较与 cost, pay, take 的用法区别："
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "1) sb. spend st. (in) doing sth./on sth. = it takes sb. st. to do sth."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：David "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "spent two hours finishing/on"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " his report last night."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "= "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "It took David two hours to finish"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " his report last night."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "昨晚戴维花了 2 个小时完成他的报告。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "2) sb. spend money (in) doing sth./on sth. = sb. pay money for sth. = it costs sb. money to do sth."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：My uncle "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "spent huge amounts of money decorating"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " the living room."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "= "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "It cost my uncle huge amounts of money to decorate"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " the living room."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "我叔叔花了一大笔钱来装饰客厅。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "I "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "spent $120 on"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " my new dress."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "= I "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "paid $120 for"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " my new dress."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "我花了 120 美元买新连衣裙。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
